    \u0111\u1ED1:</color> Ph\xEDm F\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>M\u1EDF H\u1ED3 s\u01A1
    Ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1, C\xE2y C\u1ED5 Ng\u1EEF & T\xFAi \u0111\u1ED3:</color> Ph\xEDm
    I ho\u1EB7c Tab\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>B\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3 Chi\u1EBFn thu\u1EADt
    & Nh\u1EADt k\xFD Chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u:</color> Ph\xEDm M (B\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3)
    / Ph\xEDm L (Combat Log)\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>T\u1ED5 \u0111\u1ED9i Co-op 3\u20134
    Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi:</color> K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i LAN tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp ho\u1EB7c
    s\xE1t c\xE1nh c\xF9ng AI Hunter th\xF4ng minh.\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>Ph\xEDm
    t\u1EAFt Ki\u1EC3m th\u1EED Nhanh trong Dungeon:</color> F5 (+1 C\u1EA5p), F6
    (R\u1EDBt \u0110\u1ED3), F7 (T\u1EDBi Ph\xF2ng Boss), F8 (D\u1ECDn Ph\xF2ng)."
